# The F/P's third class node: Ifrit rages for three seconds and strikes every
# 0.6 seconds, six lines on twelve enemies.
#
# 600ms is GMS's `x`, the one number in its common block the tooltip never uses,
# which is also where Spirit of Snow's timing was found. What confirms it is
# that `t`, the 0.6 seconds added per active Fervent Drain, is the same number:
# each stack buys exactly one more strike, and the window runs 3 to 6 seconds as
# five strikes become ten.
#
# "Active Fervent Drain" means burns up, capped at five, the same count that
# skill reads for itself. On a boss the F/P usually has two to four: Flame Sweep
# and Ifrit always, DoT Punisher and Poison Nova for part of their 25-second
# cycles. So the window really varies here; it is not a cap in disguise.
#
# Weak next to its siblings on purpose: 26,400% at most against Poison Nova's
# 66,000%, as GMS wrote it. It is filler beside the branch's two big buttons,
# and its numbers are all its own.
#
# Twelve enemies stands: the client gives this skill no hitbox, so the stated
# cap is the reach.
#
# masonym's 480ms cast isn't what it costs: buffs are cast from a sequence,
# which paces them all at 120ms.
#
# GMS's "only when Ifrit is summoned" is the required skill. Summons here are
# permanent once learned, so the condition always holds, but a book that hasn't
# paid for Ifrit can't have this.
name: "Elemental Fury"
description:
  "Unleash the fury of flame in the form of an enraged spirit. Can only be "
  "used when Ifrit is summoned. Unaffected by attack reflection."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ACTIVE
tags: SKILL_TAG_FIRE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_FIRE_POISON_ARCH_MAGE_V skill_order: 3 }
v_node: V_NODE_KIND_JOB
max_level: 30
required_skill {
  skill_name: "Ifrit"
  level: 20
}
base_delay_ms: 120
cooldown_seconds: 60.0
buff {
  duration_seconds: 3.0
  duration_seconds_per_dot: 0.6
  dot_count_cap: 5
  pulse {
    label: "Enraged Ifrit"
    cast_interval_seconds: 0.6
    lines: 6
    max_enemies: 12
    base { skill_pct: 2.08 }
    per_level { skill_pct: 0.08 }
  }
}
